{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22442","headline":"初入峡有感 · 白居易","name":"初入峡有感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上有万仞山，下有千丈水。\n苍苍两崖间，阔狭容一苇。\n瞿唐呀直泻，灩澦屹中峙。\n未夜黑岩昏，无风白浪起。\n大石如刀劒，小石如牙齿。\n一步不可行，况千三百里。\n苒蒻竹篾𥮘，欹危檝师趾\n一跌无完舟，吾生系於此。\n常闻仗忠信，蛮貊可行矣。\n自古漂沈人，岂尽非君子。\n况吾时与命，蹇舛不足恃。\n常恐不才身，复作无名死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}